<title>USA: ComStream signs $4.5 mln deal with Reuters.</title>
<headline>ComStream signs $4.5 mln deal with Reuters.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital transmission company ComStream Corp said on Thursday that it had signed a $4.5 million ageement to provide Reuters Holdings Plc, an information service, with a new generation of digital satellite receivers.</p>
<p>The receiver, called a CBR202, was built exclusively for the Reuters private satellite network, ComStream said in a statement.</p>
<p>Delivery of the receivers will begin this quarter, ComStream said.</p>
</text>
